        "TileImage": "$($repository c453770d-4b2d-494e-9c55-a8609ac6a1ab).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYou were meant to be enjoying a peaceful stay at the Hokkaido resort — hot springs, mountain air and overpriced sushi. Unfortunately, your “vacation” has been interrupted by a small contractual obligation.\r\rSeveral guests and staff now require ICA attention. Consider this a working holiday.\r\rAnd remember, 47 — there’s no need to bring your own weapon when security has already done the shopping for you. How thoughtful of them.\r\r-Twiice\r\n\r\n<HCCE>",
